cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset/analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "VEGGIE Tomato (VEG-05 / OSD-767): Spaceflight Transcriptomics of Solanum lycopersicum cv. 'Red Robin' — leaf and adventitious root re-analysis"
abstract: >-
  Independent bulk RNA-seq re-analysis of the NASA VEG-05 experiment (OSD-767 /
  GLDS-709), in which dwarf tomato (Solanum lycopersicum cv. 'Red Robin') was
  grown aboard the ISS under red- and blue-rich light versus ground controls.
  Includes DESeq2 differential expression (leaf and adventitious root), GO/KEGG
  functional enrichment, published-marker cell-type cross-reference,
  light x spaceflight interaction models, KEGG pathway overlays, a draft
  manuscript, and a comparison against the original publication (Dixit et al. 2026).
type: dataset
authors:
